                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Core i3 2.40GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> GeForce GT730(VRAM 1GB)<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Unfortunately Spelunker Party! does not support Radeon HD 57xx series graphics cards.</li></ul>"
